  <para style="h">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo intumwa, ntatumwe n’abantu kandi bidaciye ku muntu n’umwe, ariko natumwe na Yesu Kristo n’Imana Data yamuzuye mu bapfuye, <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />hamwe na bene Data bose turi kumwe,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="GAL 1:2">Turabandikiye mwebwe amashengero y’i Galatiya:<verse eid="GAL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibane namwe. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Uwo Kristo ni we yatanze ubugingo bwiwe ku bw’ivyaha vyacu, nk’uko Imana Data wa twese yari yarabigomvye, kugira ngo adukize iki gihe kibi turimwo. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Icubahiro kibe icayo ibihe vyose, Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa twabashikirije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ndatangajwe n’ingene mwihuse cane kuva ku Mana yabahamagariye kuba mu buntu bwa Kristo, mugakurikira ubundi butumwa butandukanye n’ubwo twababwiye, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />kandi mu vy’ukuri ata bundi Butumwa Bwiza buhari. Biragaragara ko hariho abantu babatera kuzazanirwa mu kugoramika Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ariko, naho yoba twebwe, canke umumarayika avuye mw’ijuru, akaza ababwira Ubutumwa butandukanye n’ubwo twababwiye, umuvumo w’Imana ube kuri we! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Nk’uko twabivuze ubwa mbere, n’ubu ndabisubiyemwo: umuntu wese yobabwira ubutumwa butandukanye n’ubwo mwakiriye, umuvumo w’Imana ube kuri we!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Jewe ubu noba nkirondera kwemerwa n’abantu, aho kurondera kwemerwa n’Imana? Canke ubu noba nkirondera kunezereza abantu? Iyo mba nkirondera kunezereza abantu, simba ndi umukozi wa Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuhamagaro wanje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Bene Data, ndashaka ko mumenya ko Ubutumwa Bwiza nababwiye butavuye mu vyiyumviro vy’umuntu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Sinabuhawe n’umuntu n’umwe, kandi si ubwo nigishijwe. Ariko, naburonse ndabuhishuriwe na Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Mwarumvise ingene nari mbayeho nkiri mw’idini ry’Abayuda, ingene nahama ishengero ry’Imana nkobeje rwose kugira ngo ndarizimanganye. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Ico gihe, nari imbere rwose mw’idini ry’Abayuda, kurusha abandi bo mu runganwe rwanje, kandi nari mfise umwete mwinshi cane wo kwitondera imigenzo ya ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Ariko kuva nkiri mu nda ya mama, Imana yari yarantoranije, impamagara mu buntu bwayo. Hanyuma birayihimbara <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />kumpishurira Umwana wayo kugira ngo nanje ndamumenyekanishe mu Banyamahanga; kandi ivyo bibaye, sinagishije inama umuntu n’umwe, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />kandi sinabanje kuja i Yerusalemu kubaza ababaye intumwa imbere yanje, ahubwo naciye nja muri Arabiya, mu nyuma ngaruka i Damasiko.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Inyuma y’aho, haheze imyaka itatu, ni ho naduga i Yerusalemu kugira ngo tumenyane na Kefa, tumarana imisi cumi n’itanu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Nta yindi ntumwa twabonanye, kiretse Yakobo mwene nyina w’Umwami wacu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Ndi imbere y’Imana sinshobora kubesha, ivyo ndabandikiye ni ukuri.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Mvuye aho, naciye nja mu ntara za Siriya na Kilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Amashengero ya Kristo y’i Yudaya ntiyari anzi. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ico bari barumvise kuri jewe ni inkuru yavuga ngo: “Wa muntu yahora aduhama ubu asigaye yigisha ukwizera yigeze kugerageza kuzimanganya.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Maze bahimbaza Imana ku bwanje.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yaremewe n’intumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Hanyuma, haciye imyaka cumi n’ine, naciye nsubira ndaduga i Yerusalemu, ariko ico gihe twari kumwe na Baranaba, kandi na Tito twarajanye. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nagiyeyo kubera ko Imana yari yampishuriye ko nkwiye kujayo. Nshitseyo, nabonanye mu mwiherero na bamwe mu barongozi b’ishengero b’imbere, ndabamenyesha Ubutumwa nigisha mu Banyamahanga. Nashaka kumenya neza ko ivyo nakoze mbere hamwe n’ivyo nariko ndakora ico gihe, ntariko nirukira ubusa. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Ariko, baranshigikiye, mbere na Tito twari kumwe, ntibigeze bamugobera ngo akebwe kandi ari Umugiriki. <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Ivyerekeye ugukebwa vyazanywe n’abiyita abizera kandi atari bo, banyegeteye muri twebwe mu mpisho, bazanywe no kuraba umwidegemvyo dufise muri Kristo Yesu kugira ngo bishobotse bongere kuduhindura abaja b’imigenzo y’idini ry’Abayuda. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Ntitwigeze tubibemerera n’akanya isase, kugira ngo ukuri kw’Ubutumwa Bwiza kuzigamwe ku bwanyu.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Abarongozi b’imbere mw’ishengero nta co bari bafise bongera ku butumwa navuga. Kandi icubahiro cabo nta co cari kimbariye, kuko nzi ko Imana itarobanura abantu ku butoni. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ahubwo, batahuye ko nahawe igikorwa co kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza mu batakebwe, nk’uko Petero na we yahawe ico gikorwa mu bakebwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Kuko uko Imana yariko ikorera muri Petero nk’intumwa mu Bayuda ni ko yariko ikorera muri jewe nk’intumwa mu Banyamahanga. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakobo, Kefa na Yohana, abari bazwi nk’inkingi z’ishengero, bamaze kubona ubuntu bw’Imana buri kuri jewe, baciye baduha ukuboko twe na Baranaba nk’ikimenyetso c’uko dufatanije ibikorwa. Baremeye ko twebwe dukwiye kuja mu Banyamahanga, na bo bakaja mu bakebwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Ico batwihanikirije kwari uko twokwibuka kwitwararika abakene, kandi ico nanje nkaba namye ndagifitiye ishaka kuva kera.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ahaririza Petero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ariko, igihe Kefa yaza muri Antiyokiya, namuharirije turi imbere y’abandi bose kuko vyaboneka ko ariko akora ibimutsindisha. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Agishika, yasangira n’Abanyamahanga, batari barakebwe. Ariko abantu barungitswe na Yakobo bashitse, aca atangura kwigira kure kubera gutinya abo bo mu mugwi w’abakebwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Abandi Bayuda baciye bifatanya na we muri ubwo buryarya, ndetse na Baranaba ubwiwe atwarwa na bwo.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Maze kubona ko batariko bakorera mu kuri kw’Ubutumwa Bwiza, nabwiye Kefa imbere y’abari aho bose nti: “Nimba wewe Umuyuda, wahevye imigenzo y’Abayuda ukabaho nk’Umunyamahanga, ni kuki ugoberera Abanyamahanga gukurikiza imigenzo y’Abayuda?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Twebwe twavutse turi Abayuda, ntituri Abanyamahanga b’abanyavyaha. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Ariko ico tuzi ni uko umuntu atemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi kubera ibikorwa vy’ivyagezwe, ahubwo abihabwa no kwizera Kristo Yesu. Natwe nyene twizeye Kristo gutyo turonka kwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi kubera kumwizera, atari kubera gukurikiza ivyagezwe, kuko ata muntu n’umwe azokwemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi kubera gukurikiza ivyagezwe.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ariko nimba turondera kwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi biciye mu kwizera Kristo, maze tukagaragara nk’abanyavyaha kuko twahevye ivyagezwe; mbega bisigura ko Kristo abaye umukozi w’icaha? Haba na mba! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ahubwo noba mbaye umunyavyaha, hamwe nosubira kwubaka ivyo nasambuye.<verse eid="GAL 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kuko ngerageje gukurikiza ivyagezwe, birantsindisha. None rero, ku bijanye n’ivyagezwe, narapfuye, kugira ngo mbeho nkorera Imana. Nabambanywe na Kristo, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />si jewe nkiriho; ariko ni Kristo ariho muri jewe. Nkiri muri uwu mubiri, mbayeho mu kwizera Umwana w’Imana yankunze akitanga ku bwanje. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Simfata minenegwe ubuntu bw’Imana, kuko hamwe iyaba ukugororoka kwoshobora kuronkerwa mu vyagezwe, Kristo yoba yapfiriye ubusa.”<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwizera mu gishingo c’Ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Mbega mwa Bagalatiya b’ibijuju, ni nde yabaroze? Ndazi neza ko ivy’urupfu rwa Yesu Kristo mwabishikirijwe neza nk’aho mwamwiboneye abambwe ku musaraba. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Rero, hariho ikintu kimwe conyene ngomba kumenya: Mbega mwahawe Mpwemu Yera kubera mwitondeye ivyagezwe vya Mose? Canke ni kubera mwizeye Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo mwumvise? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Mbega mwakabaye muri ibijuju gutyo? Mwatanguriye mu vy’Impwemu none ubu muriko mugerageza kuba abagororotse rwose mukoresheje ivy’umubiri? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Mbega imibabaro yose mwaciyemwo, yari iy’ubusa? Haba na mba ntiyari iy’ubusa. <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Ngomba kandi kwongera kubabaza, mbega Imana yabahaye Mpwemu Yera yongera ikorera ibitangaza muri mwebwe kubera mwitondera ivyagezwe? Canke ni kubera mwizeye ivyo mwumvise? <verse eid="GAL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Na Aburahamu na we “yizeye Imana, bituma imwemera nk’umugororotsi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Itanguriro 15:6</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Mutahure rero neza ko abana ba Aburahamu ari abo bizera Imana. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ivyanditswe vyari vyarerekanye ko Imana izokwemera Abanyamahanga nk’abagororotsi biciye mu kwizera, ica ibwira inkuru nziza Aburahamu imbere y’igihe iti: “Muri wewe ni ho amahanga yose azohererwa umugisha.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Itanguriro 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Nuko rero abizera Imana bose nk’uko Aburahamu yayizeye bahezagirwa co kimwe na we.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Ariko abizeye ko bazokizwa n’ivyagezwe bari musi y’umuvumo, kuko handitswe ngo: “Aravumwe umuntu adakurikiza ivyanditswe vyose mu gitabu c’ivyagezwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">Gusubiramwo 27:26</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Biraboneka rero ko ata muntu n’umwe ashobora kwemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi kubera kwubahiriza ivyagezwe, kuko Ivyanditswe bivuga biti: “Umugororotsi azobeshwaho n’ukwizera.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Habakuki 2:4</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Ivyagezwe ntibihagaze ku kwizera, ariko bivuga biti: “Uwuzokora ivyo ivyagezwe vyose bibwiriza azobeshwaho na vyo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Abalewi 18:5</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kristo yadukijije umuvumo w’ivyagezwe aho yahinduka umuvumo ku bwacu, nk’uko vyanditswe ngo: “Haravumwe uwubambwe ku giti.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">Gusubiramwo 21:23</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Yaradukijije kugira ngo umugisha wahawe Aburahamu ushikire Abanyamahanga biciye muri Kristo Yesu, kandi kugira ngo biciye mu kwizera turonke Mpwemu Yera yasezeranywe.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyagezwe hamwe n’Isezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Bene Data, reka dufatire ku karorero ko mu buzima busanzwe. Iyo umuntu agiriraniye isezerano n’uwundi, nta wushobora kurikuraho canke ngo agire ico aryongeyeko. N’aha ni ko bimeze. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Amasezerano yahawe Aburahamu n’umwana wiwe. Ivyanditswe ntibivuga ngo “n’abana biwe,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Itanguriro 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 24:7">24:7</ref></char></char></note> ni ukuvuga abantu benshi, ariko bivuga biti “ku mwana wawe,” bisigura umuntu umwe, uwo na we ni Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Ico ngomba kubabwira aha ni iki? Nuko isezerano Imana yagiraniye na Aburahamu ritashoboye gukurwaho n’iryo ryabaye inyuma y’imyaka amajana ane na mirongo itatu igihe Imana yaha Mose ivyagezwe. Iyo rivaho, Imana yari kuba irenze amasezerano. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Kuko nimba ugutorana kuva ku vyagezwe, ntikuba kukiva kw’isezerano. Ariko Imana mu buntu bwayo, yahaye Aburahamu ugutorana, ibimuhereye mw’isezerano.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />None, ivyagezwe vyatangiwe iki? Vyatanzwe i ruhande y’isezerano kugira ngo vyereke abantu ivyaha vyabo. Ariko vyari vyashizweho gushika ku kuza kwa wa mwana yasezeranywe. Imana yatumye umumarayika aha ivyagezwe Mose, na we akaba yari umuhuza w’Imana n’abantu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Umuhuza afasha iyo hari imigwi irenga umwe igomba kugiriranira amasezerano. Ariko Imana yo yari yonyene.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Mbega none hariho gusekana hagati y’ivyagezwe n’amasezerano y’Imana? Haba na mba! Nimba koko ivyagezwe vyari gushobora kuduhesha ubugingo bushasha, kubikurikiza kwari gutuma turonka ukugororoka. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ariko Ivyanditswe bivuga ko isi yose ari imbohe y’icaha, ariko ko turonka isezerano ry’Imana riduha umwidegemvyo mu kwizera Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuba abana b’Imana tubiheshwa no kwizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Imbere yuko ukwo kwizera kuza, twari imbohe z’ivyagezwe, twari tuboshwe gushika ukwizera guhishurwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Ni ukuvuga ko, ivyagezwe vyari nk’umurezi aturera gushika Kristo aje kugira ngo twemerwe n’Imana nk’abagororotsi tubihawe no kwizera. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />None rero ko ukwizera kwabonetse, ntitukirezwe n’ivyagezwe.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Mwese muri abana b’Imana kubera kwizera Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />kuko ababatijwe muri Kristo mwese mwambaye Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Nta Muyuda canke Umugiriki, nta mugurano canke uwidegemvya, nta mugore canke umugabo, mwese muri umwe muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Nimba muri aba Kristo, muri uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu, kandi muri abaragwa ku bw’isezerano Imana yahaye Aburahamu.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Ico ngomvye kuvuga ni uko iyo samuragwa akiri umwana, nta ho aba atandukaniye n’umugurano, naho ivya se vyose biba ari ivyiwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Aba musi y’uburongozi bw’abarezi biwe n’abandi bizigirwa, gushika ku myaka se yagenye. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />No kuri twebwe ni uko vyari bimeze Kristo ataraza. Twari tumeze nk’abana bakiri bato; twari abagurano, kandi turi musi y’ubushobozi bw’impwemu butegeka iyi si. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Maze igihe gikwiye kigeze, Imana irungika Umwana wayo, avyagwa n’umugore, avukira mu vyagezwe, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />kugira ngo acungure abaganzwa n’ivyagezwe, yongere atugire abana biwe bwite. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kandi kubera turi abana bayo, Imana yarungitse Mpwemu w’Umwana wayo mu mitima yacu. Ni we Mpwemu atuma dusemerera tuvuga tuti: “Aba, Data.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Nuko rero ntimukiri abagurano, ariko muri abana b’Imana bwite. Kandi ko muri abana b’Imana bwite, Imana yabagize abaragwa.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’ab’i Galatiya bitera impungenge Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kera, mutaramenya Imana, mwari mujakariye ibigirwamana. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Ariko ubu ko mwamenye Imana, na canecane ko mwamenywe na yo, ni kuki mwasubiye muri ivyo bintu vy’intege nke vy’urufatiro kandi ata co bimaze. Mugomba gusubira kwongera kuba abaja b’iyo migenzo kandi? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mugomba kurondera ukwemerwa n’Imana mu kwubahiriza imisi mikuru, amezi, ibihe n’imyaka? <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ndatinya ko kumbure ivyo nakoze vyose muri mwebwe vyapfuye ubusa.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Ndabinginze bene Data ngo mumere nkanje mu kwidegemvya kuri ivyo bintu, nk’uko nanje nabaye nkamwe abanyamahanga mu kutaganzwa n’ivyagezwe. Nta kibi mwigeze munkorera aho naza kubigisha. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Nk’uko mubizi icatumye ndababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza ubwa mbere ni uko nari ngwaye mu mubiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Naho ingwara yanje yari ikigeragezo kuri mwebwe, ntimwigeze munsuzugura canke ngo mungaye. Ariko mwanyakiriye nk’umumarayika w’Imana, canke nk’aho ari Kristo Yesu ubwiwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />None umunezero mwari mufise kiriya gihe wagiye hehe? Ndabashingira intahe ko iyo biba ari ibishoboka, mwari kwinogora amaso yanyu mukayampa. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Mbega none ubu nahindutse umwansi wanyu kubera ndababwira ukuri?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Abo bigisha b’ibinyoma babafitiye ishaka ryinshi, ariko intumbero yabo si nziza na mba. Ico bashaka ni ukubadukurako kugira ngo abe ari bo mukurikira. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Kugira ishaka ryo kubakorera ivyiza, ni vyiza mu gihe intumbero ari nziza, ariko baze bame bameze gutyo ntibabikore gusa mu gihe ndi kumwe namwe honyene. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Bana banje nkunda, abo nama ndiko ndatera ibise n’ubu kuzoshika igihe Kristo azogaragarira neza muri mwebwe, <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />ese iyo mba nari kumwe namwe ngashobora kworosha ijwi ryanje, kuko ivyanyu ndabuze n’ingene ndabifata!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sara na Hagari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nimumbwire mwebwe mugomba kuganzwa n’ivyagezwe, mbega ntimuzi ico bivuga? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Handitswe ko Aburahamu yari afise abahungu babiri, umwe ku mugore w’umuguranokazi, uwundi ku mugore yidegemvya. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Uwavutse ku muguranokazi yavutse kubera ugushaka kw’umubiri, ariko uwavutse ku mugore yidegemvya yavutse kubera isezerano ry’Imana.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Ivyo twobifatirako ikigereranyo: abo bagore babiri bagereranywa n’amasezerano abiri. Isezerano rimwe ryavuye ku musozi Sinayi, rivamwo abana bavukira kuba abagurano: Uwo ni Hagari. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Hagari agereranywa n’umusozi Sinayi wo muri Arabiya, akagereranywa kandi n’igisagara ca Yerusalemu kuko ari mu bugurano bw’ivyagezwe, hamwe n’abana biwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ariko uwundi mugore, ari we Sara, agereranywa na Yerusalemu wo mw’ijuru. Ni umugore yidegemvya, kandi ni we mama atuvyara. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Kuko handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Nezerwa, mugore w’ingumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">wewe utavyaye abana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">turikisha usemerere n’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">wewe utigeze utera ibise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">kuko abana b’umugore w’intabwa bazoba benshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">gusumba ab’uwufise umugabo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Yesaya 54:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Mweho, bene Data, muri abana b’isezerano nka Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Ico gihe uwavutse kubera gushaka kw’umubiri yarahamye uwavutse mu bubasha bwa Mpwemu. N’ubu ni ko bimeze. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Ariko Ivyanditswe bivuga iki? Bivuga ngo: “Irukana urya muguranokazi, kuko umuhungu wiwe atazosangira iragi n’umwana w’umugore yidegemvya.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Itanguriro 21:10</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />None rero bene Data, ntituri abana b’umuguranokazi, turi abana b’uwidegemvya!<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Umwidegemvyo wo muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kristo yatubohoye kugira ngo aduhe umwidegemvyo. Hagarara mushikamye rero, ntimwongere kwemera umuntu n’umwe asubira kubaremereza imitwaro y’ubuja bw’ivyagezwe.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Muvyumve neza! Jewe Pawulo, ndababwiye nti: Nimba mwizeye ko ugukebwa kwanyu kubaha ukugororoka imbere y’Imana, kuri mwebwe Kristo nta co azoba amaze na gatoya. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Ndongeye kandi ndabibabwiye. Nimba mugomba gukebwa kugira ngo mwemerwe n’Imana, mutegerezwa kwitondera no gukurikiza ivyagezwe vya Mose vyose ata na kimwe kivuyemwo. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Kuko iyo mugerageza kurondera kwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi mu kwitondera ivyagezwe, muba mutandukanijwe na Kristo, muba mutakariye kure y’ubuntu bw’Imana. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Ariko twebwe turi muri Mpwemu twiteganye igishika kwakira mu kwizera ukugororoka Imana yadusezeraniye. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Kuko muri Kristo Yesu, ugukebwa canke ukudakebwa nta kimazi bifise. Igihambaye ni ukwizera gukorera mu rukundo.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mwariko mugenda neza mu rugendo rwanyu. None ni nde yabatangiriye akababuza kwumvira ukuri? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ivyo mwemejwe, ntivyavuye kuri umwe yabahamagara. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Izo nyigisho, ni “umwambiro mukeya ariko ukakamisha irobe ryose.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Nizeye ko Imana izobarinda kwakira inyigisho zitari zo. Abariko babatera ukwo kuzazanirwa uko bari kwose bazobihanirwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Bene Data, nimba ngishishikara kwigisha ivyo gukebwa nk’uko bamwe babivuga, kubera iki noba nkiriko ndahamwa? Iyo mba ntacigisha agakiza kava ku musaraba wa Kristo, nta n’umwe biba bitsitaza. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Icompa abo babateramwo imivurungano, ngo mukebwe, bakagera aho bonyene bikona ubwabo.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubugingo bwo mu Mpwemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Bene Data, mwebwe mwahamagariwe kwidegemvya. Ariko uwo mwidegemvyo ntubatere kurondera guhaza ivyipfuzo vya kamere k’icaha. Ahubwo urukundo rukwiye gutuma mukorera bagenzi banyu. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ivyagezwe vyose bikoraniye muri iri bwirizwa rimwe rivuga ngo: “Ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda wewe nyene.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Abalewi 19:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ariko nimba mwama mufise ivyo mupfa, mukama muryana, mwirinde ntimumarane.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Ndababwira nti: Murongorwe na Mpwemu Yera ni ho mutazoshitsa ivyo kamere k’icaha kanyu kipfuza. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Kuko kamere k’icaha kipfuza ibinyuranye n’ivyo Mpwemu agomba, kandi ivyo Mpwemu yipfuza binyuranye n’ivyo kamere k’icaha kipfuza. Vyompi bigwanira muri mwebwe mugasanga ntimushobora gukora ivyo mushaka. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ariko nimwarongorwa na Mpwemu Yera ntimuzoba mukiganzwa n’ivyagezwe vya Mose.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Ibikorwa vya kamere muntu biragaragara, ni ibi: ubusambanyi, ibihumanya, ivy’isoni nke, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />Gusenga ibigirwamana, uburozi, urwanko, amatati, ishari, uburake, ukwikunda, ukwicamwo ibice, kwitandukanya, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />ukwipfuza kubi, akaborerwe, kurya birenze urugero n’ibindi bene ivyo. Ndababuriye ubugira kabiri, ko abakora ibintu nk’ivyo batazoragwa Ubwami bw’Imana.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Ariko ivyamwa vya Mpwemu Yera ni ibi: urukundo, umunezero, amahoro, ukwihangana, ingeso nziza, kugira neza, ubwizigirwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />ubugwaneza, n’ukwirinda. Ibi nta cagezwe kibibuza. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Aba Kristo Yesu baba barabamvye kamere muntu kabo hamwe n’ivyo gahahamiye n’ivyo kipfuza. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />None rero, ko tubayeho ku bwa Mpwemu, reka turongorwe na we mu buzima bwacu bwose. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Twoye kwikakisha, twirinde kwandurutsanya no kugiriranira ishari.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ico ubiba ni co wimbura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Bene Data, nihagira uwufatwa ariko akora icaha, mwebwe muhagaze neza muri Mpwemu, mwategerezwa kumufasha gusubira mu nzira nziza mu bugwaneza. Ariko namwe nyene mwirinde cane kugira ngo ntumugeragezwe nka we. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Mwikoreranire imitwaro, ni ho muzoba mushikije icagezwe ca Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Iyo wibaza ko uhambaye kandi ata co uri, uba wihenze wewe nyene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Umwe wese yari akwiye kwisuzuma mu bikorwa vyiwe, kugira ngo asanze yakoze neza bimushimishe, ariko ntabanze kwigereranya n’abandi, <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />kuko umuntu wese akwiye kwikorera umutwaro wiwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Uwigishijwe Ijambo ry’Imana, akwiye gusangira ivyiza vyose afise n’uwarimwigishije.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Ntimuhendwe: Imana nticokorwa. Ico umuntu abiba ni co azokwimbura. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Uwubiba kugira ngo anezereze kamere muntu kiwe, azokwimbura ukubora muri ako kamere nyene. Ariko uwubiba kigira ngo ahimbare Mpwemu, azokwimbura ubugingo budashira muri Mpwemu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Dukore ivyiza tudacika intege, kuko igihe gikwiye kigeze tuzokwimbura, nitutava ku gikorwa. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />None rero, uko akaryo kose kabonetse, tugirire neza bose, na canecane abo mu nzu y’abizera.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kuba icaremwe gisha biruta gukebwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Nimurabe ingene ndabandikiye mu ndome nkuru n’ukuboko kwanje!<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Abagomba kwiyerekana ku bantu mu vy’umubiri, ni bo babagoberera gukebwa, kandi ikintu conyene gituma bakora ivyo ni ukwanka guhamwa bahorwa umusaraba wa Kristo. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Mbere n’abakebwe ntibashobora gukurikiza neza ivyagezwe vyose, ariko bagomba ko mukebwa kugira ngo bishimire ugukebwa kwanyu mu mibiri yabo. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ariko jewe sinkagire ikindi nishimira atari umusaraba w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo. Ku bw’uwo, kuri jewe isi irabambwe, kandi nanje kuri yo ndabambwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ugukebwa canke ukudakebwa, nta na kimwe gifise ikimazi, igihambaye ni ukuba icaremwe gishasha. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Amahoro n’imbabazi bibane n’abagendera iyo ngingo, kandi bibe no kuri Isirayeli y’Imana.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Uhereye ubu, ntihakagire umuntu yongera kungora, kuko mfise inkovu za Yesu ku mubiri wanje.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Bene Data nkunda, ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo bubane n’impwemu yanyu. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>